OL,3,GNEWSAChancellor urges Holyrood
OL,4,Aministers to give #100 energy payment
OL,5,Ato Scottish households
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Scottish government has been
OL,8,Fchallenged to replicate a UK government
OL,9,Fscheme giving #100 to households in
OL,10,FEngland in lower council tax bands this
OL,11,Fwinter.
OL,13,FAnnouncing the measure in the Autumn
OL,14,FBudget, UK Chancellor John Healey said
OL,15,FHolyrood ministers would receive
OL,16,Fproportionate funding and urged them to
OL,17,Fprovide the payment north of the
OL,18,Fborder.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
