OL,3,GNEWSAChancellor urges Holyrood
OL,4,Aministers to give #100 energy payment
OL,5,Ato Scottish households
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Labour minister said the payment
OL,8,Fwould "help deal with rising energy
OL,9,Fbills and take the pressure off in the
OL,10,Fcoldest months".
OL,12,FHealey also committed to increasing the
OL,13,Fminimum wage, scrapping standing
OL,14,Fcharges on household gas bills and
OL,15,Fextend a VAT cut on electricity bills.
